service-disabled veteran-owned small business concern;
   (j) Contractor’s performance history with small, small disadvantaged, women-owned, veteran-owned, HUBZone, and
service-disabled veteran-owned small business subcontracting programs;
   (k) Safety precautions required for hazardous materials or operations; and
   (l) Complex financing arrangements, such as progress payments, advance payments, or guaranteed loans.

